Package: mcp-server-graylog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcp (>= 1:2.0.0),
 python3-mcp-types,
 python3-fastmcp (>= 4.0.0~b1),
Description: stdio MCP bridge to the MCP endpoint built into Graylog 7.1+
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that forwards to the experimental
 /api/mcp endpoint of a Graylog server. It builds the required Basic
 authentication header from GRAYLOG_API_TOKEN, runs read-only by default
 and exposes whatever tools the connected Graylog offers.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-graylog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.4),
 mcp-server-graylog (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Graylog MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-graylog. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-graylog binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
